## Implement Insertion Sort

Insertion Sort takes one element at a time and inserts it into the correct position in the already-sorted left part.

=========================================================================================================

arr = [5, 2, 8, 1, 3]

for i in range(1, len(arr)):
    key = arr[i]
    j = i - 1

    while j >= 0 and arr[j] > key:
        arr[j + 1] = arr[j]
        j = j - 1

    arr[j + 1] = key

print(arr)
